      },
      {
        "id": "603e6bfa-2d6d-4aed-81a8-a533b8f77fad",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# 🃏 Flashcard Generator\n\nEnter a topic; an AI writes each card as a structured front/back/category object (not a markdown blob), so downstream steps can store, query, and render them as real data — then a Code node appends the deck to a workspace file and reads the most recent cards back for review.\n\n**Pipeline:** Topic + card count → build prompt → generate card objects → one script that saves and re-reads\n\n**Try this:** change the topic or card count. Cards persist across runs — rerun to add more to the same deck."
        },
